{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">समझावन-पोथी</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">खातिर</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">देल्मास सहायक नकसा</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">पहिल शृंखला</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">नकसा नं. १</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">इसकूल, माध्यमिक इसकूल, कक्षा।</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">आम बयान।</span>","t01-01-1":"१. — ई नकसा एगो <b>माध्यमिक इसकूल</b> के <b>कक्षा</b> देखावेला। एह कक्षा में आठ गो <b>मेज</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"tabli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> आ आठ गो <b>बेंच</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"benki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button> बा। हर बेंच पर तीन गो लइका बइठेलें। <b>मास्टर साहेब</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> आपन <b>कुरसी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"stulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button> पर, आपन <b>मंच</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"katedro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button> पर बइठल बाड़ें।","t01-02-1":"२. — मंच के बाईं ओर काँच वाला <b>आलमारी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> ठाढ़ बा। दाहिने ओर <b>करिया पटिया</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"nigra tabelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button> बा, आपन <b>झाड़न</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"vishilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button> आ <b>खड़िया</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"kreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button> के साथे।","t01-02-2":"मंच के ऊपर <b>भीत के नकसा</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup> आ एगो <b>नकसा</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"mapo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button> लटकल बा।","t01-03-1":"३. — सब लइका आपन <b>जगहा</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"plaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button> पर नइखन बइठल। योहानेस <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button> करिया पटिया लगे ठाढ़ बा ; ऊ <b>झाड़न</b> हाथ में लेके <b>रेखागणित के आकृति</b> मेटावत बा।","t01-03-2":"पेत्रुस मंच लगे बा ; ऊ <b>लिखल काम</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"skribo-taski\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button> बटोरत बा आ मास्टर साहेब लगे ले जात बा।","t01-04-1":"४. — <b>ई</b> मास्टर साहेब <b>जिंदा भाषा</b> के मास्टर बाड़ें। ऊ लइकन के परदेसी भाषा <b>(जर्मन, अंगरेजी, स्पेनिस, इटालियन, रूसी भा फ्रेंच)</b> बोले, पढ़े आ लिखे सिखावेलें।","t01-05-1":"५. — कक्षा बहुते चाकर आ बहुते अँजोर बा। छोर पर दू गो <b>रोशनदान</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"postigi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> वाला चाकर <b>खिड़की</b> आ हवा आ अँजोर खातिर <b>काँच के केवाड़</b> बा।","t01-05-2":"ई कक्षा जाड़ नइखे। एकरा के गरम करे खातिर बीच में बहुते नीक <b>अँगीठी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"furnelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button> बा, आपन <b>नली</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"tubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button> के साथे।","t01-05-3":"भीत में <b>लुगा के खूँटी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"vest-hoki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button> गाड़ल बा ; ओह पर लइकन के टोपी आ कोट लटकल बा।","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">खेले के अँगना</span>","t01-06-1":"६. — <b>घड़ी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"horlojo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button> नौ बजके पाँच मिनट देखावत बा।","t01-06-2":"<b>छुट्टी के बेरा</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"amuz-tempo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button> अबहीं खतम भइल आ पढ़ाई फेरु शुरू होत बा। खेले के जगहा <b>अँगना</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"korto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button> में बा। हम कुछ लइकन के खेलत देखत बानी। एगो <b>निगरान मास्टर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Submaestro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button> ओह लोग पर नजर राखत बाड़ें।","t01-07-1":"७. — अँगना में हमनी के आउर कई गो लोग के देखत बानी जा, माने <b>इंस्पेक्टर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspektisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, <b>हेडमास्टर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"(liceestro)\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button> आ <b>उप-हेडमास्टर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"censoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>।","t01-07-2":"इंस्पेक्टर इसकूलन के जाँच करेलें, हेडमास्टर माध्यमिक इसकूल चलावेलें, आ उप-हेडमास्टर पढ़ाई पर नजर राखेलें।","t01-07-3":"चउथा मनई <b>दरबान</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"pordisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button> बाड़ें। ऊ गैरहाजिर लोग के नाँव लिखे खातिर बगल में हाजिरी-रजिस्टर दबवले बाड़ें।","t01-08-1":"८. — अँगना के छोर पर <b>कसरत के सामान</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"gimnastikal aparati\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button> आ <b>हाथ के काम</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button> खातिर कारखाना बा।","t01-08-2":"एह नकसा के दाहिने ओर हमनी के <b>संगीत</b> आ <b>चित्रकारी</b> के <b>कक्षा</b> देखे लागत बानी जा।","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">बिस्तार से बयान।</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">नीक लइका।</span>","t01-09-1":"९. — मंच के दाहिने ओर के पहिला बेंच के लइका <b>हेनरिकुस</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"bho-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>स्तेफानुस</b> आ <b>कारोलुस</b> बाड़ें।","t01-09-2":"हेनरिकुस बहुते धेयान देवे वाला आ मेहनती बा ; ऊ मास्टर साहेब के सुनत बा। ओकर मेज पर <b>कापी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, <b>किताब</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"libro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, <b>शब्दकोश</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"lexiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button> आ <b>कलमदान</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"skribiluyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button> बा। ओकर किताब में बहुते <b>पन्ना</b> बा ; हर अध्याय में कई गो <b>पैरा</b> आ हर <b>लाइन</b> में बहुते <b>सबद</b> बा।","t01-09-4":"ओकर पड़ोसी स्तेफानुस <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button> लगनशील बा। ऊ आपन कापी में अगिला बेर के पाठ लिखत बा। ओकर <b>अच्छर</b> सुंदर बा। ओकर किताब बंद बा ; हमनी के खाली ओकर <b>जिल्द</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"kovrilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button> देखत बानी जा। ओकरा लगे ओकर <b>परकार</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"kompaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button> धइल बा।","t01-09-5":"कारोलुस <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button> आपन किताब हाथ में पकड़ले बा ; ऊ आपन पाठ फेरु पढ़े खातिर ओकरा के खोलत बा। हर लइका नियर ओकरो आगे <b>दवात</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"inkuyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button> बा। ऊ कहल मानेला।","t01-10-1":"१०. — बगल के मेज पर <b>लुदोविकुस, अंतोनियुस</b> आ <b>पाउलुस</b> बाड़ें। लुदोविकुस आपन <b>पाठ</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"leciono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button> सुनावत बा आ मास्टर साहेब के <b>सवालन</b> के जवाब देत बा। अंतोनियुस <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button> बहुते बेधेयान बा, कबो-कबो त मास्टर साहेब ओकरा के सजा देलें। पाउलुस <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button> नीक संगी बा, मिलनसार आ मददगार। ऊ बहुते धेयान देवेला।","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">खराब लइका।</span>","t01-11-1":"११. — हेनरिकुस के पाछे <b>गेओर्गियुस</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Georgius\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button> बा। ऊ खराब लइका नइखे, बाकिर ऊ <b>बतकुच्चन</b>, बेधेयान आ चंचल बा। ओकर <b>हलुकपन</b> आ <b>बेअदबी</b> पढ़ाई में <b>गड़बड़ी</b> पैदा करेला आ अकसर ओकरा के कड़ा <b>चेतावनी</b> मिलेला। ओकर <b>कच्चा कापी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"klado-kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button> मैल बा, ऊ आपन <b>कलम</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"plumo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button> से ओह पर <b>सियाही के दाग</b> लगावेला, एहीसे ऊ हरमेसा आपन <b>रबर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"efacokauchuko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button> राखेला ; ओकर <b>बस्ता</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"kayeruyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button> फाटल बा, काहेकि ऊ बहुते लापरवाह बा। ऊ आपन <b>पेंसिल के खोल</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"krayoniero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button> जिंदा भाषा के कक्षा में काहे ले आवेला ?","t01-11-2":"ओकर पड़ोसी एदमुंदुस <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button> ओकरा के पसंद ना करे। ऊ सचहूँ कुछ सुस्त बा, बाकिर चुप आ सांत बा। ऊ बतियावे ना ; बाकिर सुने के बदले ऊ आपन <b>पढ़े के किताब</b> के <b>कहानी</b> पढ़ल पसंद करेला।","t01-11-3":"एह बेंच के तिसरका लइका <b>लुदोविकुस</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludovikus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button> बा। ऊ मेहनती बा। ऊ उजर <b>कागज</b> पर लिखत बा। आपन आगे ऊ आपन <b>सोखता</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"absorbiva papero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button> धइले बा।","t01-12-1":"१२. — मास्टर साहेब के बाईं ओर के दुसरका बेंच के लइका बहुते छोट बाड़ें। पहिलका, छोटका <b>एमिलियुस</b>, अबहीं ठीक से लिखे ना जानेला, ऊ आपन <b>पाटी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"ardezo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>, आपन <b>पाटी के पेंसिल</b> आ आपन <b>स्पंज</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"sponjo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button> ले आवेला।","t01-12-2":"ओकरा बगल में <b>आउगुस्तुस</b> आ <b>बेर्नार्दुस</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernardus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button> बाड़ें। ई दुसरका नीक काम करेला, बाकिर ओकर <b>पहिनावा</b> बहुते बेढंग बा।","t01-13-1":"१३. — ओह लोग के पाछे तीन गो <b>अलसी</b> बाड़ें। <b>आल्बेर्तुस</b> आपन पाठ ना याद करे। <b>याकोबुस</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Iakobus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button> सुने के बदले सूतेला। ओकर <b>अलसीपन</b> से ओकरा <b>डाँट</b> आ <b>सजा</b> तक मिलेला। आ <b>क्रिस्तियानुस</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Kristianus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button> बहुते गैरजिम्मेदार बा। ऊ खराब <b>बेवहार</b> करेला आ सुधरे के कवनो कोसिस नइखे करत।","t01-14-1":"१४. — ओकर पड़ोसी लोग एकरा उलटा नीक चालचलन वाला बाड़ें। <b>एर्नेस्तुस</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernestus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button> के ढंग आ नेम पसंद बा, ऊ हरमेसा आपन <b>पटरी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"linealo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button> आ आपन <b>पेंसिल</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"krayono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button> इस्तेमाल करेला। ऊ <b>बाहरी लइका</b> बा।","t01-14-2":"<b>फ्रांसिस्कुस</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Franciskus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button> <b>होस्टल के लइका</b> बा, ऊ वरदी पहिनेला, इसकूल में खाला आ इसकूल में सूतेला। ऊ नीक <b>संगी</b> बा।","t01-14-3":"माउरिकियुस आपन <b>पेंसिल</b> आपन <b>चाकू</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"kulteleto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button> से छिलत बा, ऊ बहुते सलीकेदार बा।","t01-14-4":"ऊ आपन सब किताब ले आवेला, आपन <b>बियाकरन</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"gramatiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, आपन <b>नोटबुक</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"notlibreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button>, आ <b>लिखे के गद्दी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"skribkuseno\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button> तक। ओकर <b>इसकूल के झोरा</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"skolsako\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button> ओकरा पाछे भुइयाँ पर बा।","t01-14-5":"कक्षा के छोर पर के दुनो मेज <b>नीक लइकन</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"bona lernanti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button> से भरल बा।","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">चित्रकारी आ संगीत।</span>","t01-15-1":"१५. — <b>चित्रकारी के कक्षा</b> में भीत पर सुंदर <b>नमूना</b> टँगल बा आ छत से <b>छाता</b> वाला <b>बत्ती</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button> लटकल बा। <b>मास्टर साहेब</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button> बहुते धीरजवाला बाड़ें, ऊ लइकन के <b>चित्र</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"desegnuri\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button> सुधारेलें आ ओह लोग के देख के <b>मूरत</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"busto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> बनावल सिखावेलें।","t01-16-1":"१६. — <b>संगीत के कक्षा</b> बहुते मजेदार लागत बा। ओहिजा संगीत पढ़ल सिखावल जाला, <b>सुर-रेखा</b> पर लिखल <b>सुर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"gamnoti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> (सा, रे, ग, म, प, ध, नी = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.) गावल, <b>कुंजी</b> पहिचानल आ मीठ <b>धुन</b> गावल। संगीत के कागज <b>रिहल</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pupitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button> पर धइल जाला। एगो लइका <b>पियानो बजावत</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"pianopleas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button> बा आ <b>संगीत के मास्टर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"muzik-docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button> <b>ताल देत</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"skandas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button> बाड़ें।","t01-17-1":"१७. — हमनी के <b>हाथ के काम</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button> वाला <b>कारखाना</b> के एगो कोना देखत बानी जा, जहाँ लइकन के लकड़ी छीलल आ लोहा रेतल सिखावल जाला। ई सब इसकूलन में नइखे।","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">बिज्ञान के कक्षा।</span>","t01-18-1":"१८. — गनित के मास्टर साहेब लइकन के <b>रेखागणित, अंकगणित, हिसाब</b> आ <b>मीटरी नाप</b> सिखावेलें। पटिया पर हमनी के रेखागणित के खास आकृति देखत बानी जा : <b>गोल</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"rondo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>चौकोर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"quadrato\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, <b>तिकोन</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triangulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, <b>रेखा</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"lineo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>।","t01-18-2":"हमनी के एगो <b>सवाल</b> भी देखत बानी जा ; ई ना त <b>जोड़</b> बा, ना <b>घटाव</b>, ना <b>गुना</b> — ई <b>भाग</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"divido\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button> बा।","t01-19-1":"१९. — मीटरी नाप के पटिया पर हमनी के देखत बानी जा : <b>मीटर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"metro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>तराजू</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balanco\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button> आ ओकर <b>बटखरा</b>, <b>लीटर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"ponderili, litro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>डेकालीटर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"dekalitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>डेसीलीटर</b> आ <b>घन मीटर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"metral kubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>।","t01-19-2":"लइकन <b>प्रकृति-बिज्ञान</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button>, जीव-बिज्ञान <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, बनस्पति-बिज्ञान <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botaniko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, भू-बिज्ञान <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> आ <b>इतिहास</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button> भी पढ़ेलें।","t01-19-3":"आलमारी में <b>भौतिकी</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button> आ <b>रसायन</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"kemio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button> के औजार बा।","t01-19-4":"आलमारी के ऊपर बा : <b>गोला</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"sfero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, <b>शंकु</b> आ <b>भूगोला</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"terglobo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>।","t01-19-5":"पटियन के ऊपर दुनिया के पाँच हिस्सा देखावे वाला <b>नकसा</b> लटकल बा : <b>यूरोप</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>एशिया</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Azia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>अफ्रीका</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afrika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>अमेरिका</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup> आ <b>ओसीनिया</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oceania\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, आ दू गो बड़का महासागर, <b>प्रशांत महासागर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Pacifiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button> आ <b>अटलांटिक महासागर</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>।<span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) <i>बपतिसमा के नाँव</i> खातिर सलाह बा कि ओकनी के लैटिन रूप में लिखल जाव। अनगिनत फरक से बाँचे के एहे एगो उपाय बा। ना त <i>Giovanni, Jean, Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan</i> में से कवन चुनल जाव ? का हमनी के बपतिसमा के नाँव खातिर अलगे सबदकोस बनाइब जा ? लैटिन से ओकनी के कर्ता-रूप लीं आ कहीं : <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus; Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Gram. Kompleta)।"}}
